Formula: 
\[
M = P \frac{r(1+r)^n}{(1+r)^n-1}
\]

where `P = CHF ${principal.toLocaleString()}`, `r = ${annualRate} / 12 = ${monthlyRate.toFixed(6)}`, and `n = ${payments}` monthly payments.`

